      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for clarifying. i'm just finding the whole thing kinda messy with all these tiny rules for different styles. it feels like such a headache to keep track of every single comma and \"et al\" when there are so many people involved in one paper. is there like a general rule of thumb for keeping it clean so it doesn't look like a total disaster?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
