      "content": "A good rule of thumb is to pick one citation method and stick to it rigorously throughout your entire review. Use citation management software like Zotero or Mendeley if possible; these tools handle the tricky formatting automatically for you. If doing it manually, consistency is your best friend—whatever you do for the first citation, do it exactly the same way for every subsequent one.",
